:root {
    --primary-dark: #0f2e1e;
    --gold-premium: #c5a059;
    --accent-gold: #d4af37;
    --off-white: #fbfbf9;
    --text-dark: #1a1a1a;
    --gray-light: #f2f4f2;
}

* { box-sizing: border-box; }

body {
    font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    background-color: var(--off-white);
    color: var(--text-dark);
    line-height: 1.8;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

/* ===== HEADER ===== */
header {
    background: linear-gradient(rgba(15, 46, 30, 0.85), rgba(15, 46, 30, 0.85)),
        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b?q=80&w=2000');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    background-attachment: fixed;
    min-height: 65vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    border-bottom: 8px solid var(--gold-premium);
    animation: fadeIn 1s ease-out;
}

header h1 {
    font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 5rem);
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 4px;
}

header p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    margin-top: 10px;
    opacity: 0.9;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--gold-premium);
    padding-top: 15px;
    max-width: 800px;
}

/* ===== WRAPPER ===== */
.wrapper {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: -80px auto 80px;
    background: white;
    border-radius: 30px;
    padding: clamp(30px, 5vw, 60px);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.12);
}

/* ===== SECTION HEADER ===== */
.section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    animation: slideUp 0.6s ease-out;
}

.section-header h2 {
    color: var(--primary-dark);
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
}

.section-header h2::after {
    content: '';
    width: 60%;
    height: 4px;
    background: var(--gold-premium);
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -10px;
    right: 20%;
    border-radius: 2px;
}

.section-header p {
    color: var(--text-dark);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.1rem);
    margin-top: 30px;
}

/* ===== ITINERARY ===== */
.itinerary {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 40px;
}

.day-block {
    margin-bottom: 60px;
    border-right: 10px solid var(--primary-dark);
    padding-right: 30px;
    position: relative;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    animation: slideInRight 0.6s ease-out forwards;
    opacity: 0;
}

.day-block[data-day="1"] { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
.day-block[data-day="2"] { animation-delay: 0.2s; }
.day-block[data-day="3"] { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
.day-block[data-day="4"] { animation-delay: 0.4s; }
.day-block[data-day="5"] { animation-delay: 0.5s; }

.day-block:hover {
    border-right-color: var(--gold-premium);
    transform: translateX(-10px);
}

.day-num {
    background: var(--gold-premium);
    color: var(--primary-dark);
    padding: 8px 25px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.day-block:hover .day-num {
    background: var(--primary-dark);
    color: var(--gold-premium);
    transform: scale(1.05);
}

.slot {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 20px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.slot-time {
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--gold-premium);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--gray-light);
    margin-left: 20px;
    padding-left: 15px;
}

.slot-content {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

.slot-content b {
    color: var(--primary-dark);
    font-weight: 700;
}

.slot:hover .slot-content {
    color: var(--gold-premium);
}

/* ===== INFO GRID ===== */
.info-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 30px;
    margin-top: 60px;
}

.card-luxury {
    background: var(--primary-dark);
    color: white;
    padding: clamp(30px, 5vw, 45px);
    border-radius: 25px;
    border-bottom: 10px solid var(--gold-premium);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    animation: scaleIn 0.6s ease-out;
}

.card-luxury:hover {
    transform: translateY(-10px);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(15, 46, 30, 0.3);
}

.card-luxury h3 {
    color: var(--gold-premium);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    margin-top: 0;
    font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
}

.price-display {
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    margin: 20px 0;
    display: block;
    color: var(--gold-premium);
}

.price-display span {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--gold-premium);
    opacity: 0.8;
}

.logistics-box {
    background: var(--gray-light);
    padding: clamp(30px, 5vw, 45px);
    border-radius: 25px;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    animation: scaleIn 0.6s ease-out 0.1s both;
}

.logistics-box h3 {
    color: var(--primary-dark);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    margin-top: 0;
}

.logistics-box:hover {
    background: white;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
}

.specs-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
}

.specs-list li {
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    padding-right: 30px;
    position: relative;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.specs-list li::before {
    content: '✓';
    position: absolute;
    right: 0;
    color: var(--gold-premium);
    font-weight: 900;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
}

.specs-list li:hover {
    padding-right: 45px;
    color: var(--primary-dark);
}

/* ===== FOOTER ===== */
footer {
    background: var(--primary-dark);
    color: white;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    text-align: center;
    border-top: 10px solid var(--gold-premium);
}

.footer-logo {
    font-family: 'Amiri', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    color: var(--gold-premium);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

footer p {
    margin: 10px 0;
    font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 2vw, 1rem);
}

/* ===== ANIMATIONS ===== */
@keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; }
    to { opacity: 1; }
}

@keyframes slideUp {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(30px);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
    }
}

@keyframes slideInRight {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateX(50px);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateX(0);
    }
}

@keyframes scaleIn {
    from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: scale(0.95);
    }
    to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: scale(1);
    }
}

/* ===== RESPONSIVE DESIGN ===== */
@media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .wrapper {
        margin: -60px auto 60px;
        border-radius: 20px;
    }

    header h1 {
        letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .info-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
    header {
        min-height: 50vh;
    }

    .wrapper {
        margin: -40px auto 40px;
        border-radius: 15px;
        padding: 20px;
    }

    .section-header h2::after {
        width: 80%;
        right: 10%;
    }

    .day-block {
        border-right-width: 6px;
        padding-right: 20px;
    }

    .slot {
        grid-template-columns: 100px 1fr;
        gap: 15px;
    }

    .slot-time {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        margin-left: 15px;
    }

    .slot-content {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
}

@media (max-width: 480px) {
    header {
        min-height: 40vh;
    }

    .wrapper {
        margin: -30px auto 30px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 15px;
    }

    header h1 {
        letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    header p {
        border-top: none;
        padding-top: 10px;
        margin-top: 5px;
    }

    .section-header {
        margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .day-block {
        border-right-width: 4px;
        padding-right: 15px;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .day-num {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        padding: 6px 20px;
    }

    .slot {
        grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .slot-time {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin-left: 10px;
        padding-left: 10px;
    }

    .slot-content {
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .card-luxury,
    .logistics-box {
        padding: 20px;
    }

    .price-display {
        margin: 15px 0;
    }

    footer {
        padding: 40px 15px;
    }

    .footer-logo {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
}

/* ===== PRINT STYLES ===== */
@media print {
    header {
        background: var(--primary-dark);
    }

    .wrapper {
        box-shadow: none;
        border-radius: 0;
    }

    .day-block {
        page-break-inside: avoid;
    }
}this.style.transform
# 🚴‍♂️ Horizon (أُفق) - Sustainable E-Bike Tourism Project

A graduation project showcasing a sustainable 5-day electric bike tour across Syria, combining modern technology with traditional tourism experiences.

## 📋 Project Overview

**Project Name:** Horizon (أُفق)  
**Duration:** 5 Days  
**Mode:** Electric Bike (E-Bike) Tours  
**Route:** Syrian Countryside & Heritage Sites  
**Student:** Yazn Malhim  
**Advisor:** Dr. Morhaff Al-Hamoud  
**Institution:** Homs University, Faculty of Tourism  
**Year:** 2026

## 🗺️ Route Details

### Day 1: Nasra - Mozineh Dam
- E-bike calibration and digital map distribution
- Visit to Hosn Castle (Crac des Chevaliers)
- Traditional lunch at castle restaurant
- Overnight camping at Mozineh Dam

### Day 2: Al-Hawash - Mount Al-Sayih
- Mountain breakfast from local farms
- Climb to Virgin Mary statue
- Home-stay with Syrian families (authentic experience)
- Dinner preparation workshop

### Day 3: Safita Forest Trails
- Forest biking path to Safita city
- Historic Safita Tower visit
- Traditional Syrian oven bread-making workshop
- Homemade bread (Manakish) tasting

### Day 4: Misyaf - Al-Duwayat Cave
- Natural cave exploration
- Agricultural tourism: fruit harvesting
- Traditional "Khubz Al-Mella" bread preparation
- Mountain campfire gathering

### Day 5: Golden Descent to Tartus
- Natural thermal spring therapy (Wasil Baths)
- Sunset descent toward Tartus
- Beach swimming and trip memories distribution

## 💰 Pricing

**Total Package:** 1,000,000 Syrian Pounds (Luxury-Eco)

### Includes:
- ✅ E-bike rental (500W Mid-drive, 48V Lithium battery)
- ✅ Support vehicle (4x4) for luggage and supplies
- ✅ Professional bike mechanic with spare parts
- ✅ All meals (local cuisine)
- ✅ Accommodation (camping & home-stay)
- ✅ Drone photography & videography
- ✅ Digital route maps
- ✅ Professional guide

## 🛠️ Technical Stack

- **Frontend:** HTML5, CSS3 (Responsive Design)
- **JavaScript:** Vanilla JS with Intersection Observer
- **Fonts:** Cairo & Amiri (Arabic typography)
- **Design:** RTL Support, Mobile-First Approach
- **Hosting:** GitHub Pages

## 📱 Features

### Design Features
- ✨ Fully responsive (Desktop, Tablet, Mobile)
- 🌐 Arabic (RTL) & English support
- 📊 Interactive timeline interface
- 🎨 Premium color scheme (Dark Green & Gold)
- ♿ Accessibility compliant

### Interactive Elements
- Smooth scroll animations
- Hover effects on day blocks
- Fade-in animations
- Responsive grid layouts
- Touch-friendly mobile interface

